    <briefdescription>
<para>A mempool to store objects sized within one multiple of alloc_factor. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Is a member of the red-black tree which contains all such pools.</para><para>Example: let&apos;s assume alloc_factor is 1.1. There will be an instance of <ref refid="structfactor__pool" kindref="compound">factor_pool</ref> for objects of size from 300 to 330, from 330 to 363, and so on. </para>    </detaileddescription>
